WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:08.610
Find your way around the employee files, then add a new employee with their job and salary.

2
00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:13.560
Employees is the staff file of the mall: everyone, by department.

3
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:21.000
At the top: the monthly payroll cost, who is on leave today and leave waiting for you.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.260
Headcount by department. Each row filters the list below.

5
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:31.090
Coming up warns you about contracts and probation periods that end soon.

6
00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:34.960
To add someone, choose New employee.

7
00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:39.530
Their name as on their ID, in English.

8
00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:43.100
And in Arabic, for payslips and letters.

9
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.980
The department.

10
00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:50.930
The job title.

11
00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:58.270
The start date is today and probation is filled in for three months. Change them if needed.

12
00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:05.010
The basic salary. Payroll, social insurance and tax are worked out from it every month.

13
00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:11.620
Add employee. Their file holds documents, leave balances, advances and every payslip.
